{"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/presentinginperson"]}],"metadata":{"role":"article","title":"Presenting in person","modules":[{"name":"OID4VCWallet"}],"roleHeading":"Article"},"kind":"article","abstract":[{"text":"Share an mdoc with a reader nearby over Bluetooth, or be the reader,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"with ISO\/IEC 18013-5 device retrieval.","type":"text"}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/PresentingInPerson","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"seeAlsoSections":[{"title":"Presenting in person","identifiers":["doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/ProximityPresentation","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/ProximityReaderIdentity","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/ProximityTimeouts","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/ProximityError"],"generated":true,"anchor":"Presenting-in-person"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"level":2,"text":"Overview","type":"heading","anchor":"Overview"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"In person, the holder shows a QR code and the reader scans it: the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"code carries the holder’s ephemeral key and how to reach it over"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Bluetooth LE. The two devices then exchange encrypted messages over"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"GATT. The package carries the Bluetooth side itself: your app shows or"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"scans the QR code, follows the session’s states, and asks the holder."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Engagement is by QR code only. NFC engagement (a tap instead of the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"code) is in OID4VCgo’s Kotlin library, not this package: an iOS holder"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"can’t answer a reader’s tap, and an iOS reader can’t tap a holder. An"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Android reader or holder that offers both still works with this"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"package over the QR code."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Both sides need "},{"code":"NSBluetoothAlwaysUsageDescription","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" in the app’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Info.plist. Keep the app in the foreground during a session: neither"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"side keeps one going while the app is suspended. A session answers one"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"request. Bluetooth failures are "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/ProximityError","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":"s; protocol failures"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"are "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletError","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":"s."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":3,"text":"Share as the holder","type":"heading","anchor":"Share-as-the-holder"},{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet\/startProximityPresentation(timeouts:modes:)","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" returns a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/ProximityPresentation","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" whose "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/ProximityPresentation\/qrCode","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" you"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"show. It offers both "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/ProximityBLEMode","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":"s by default: it advertises"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"for the reader and scans for it at once, until a reader connects"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"either way (a reader offered both should connect in central client"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"mode). Pass "},{"code":"modes","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" to offer one. It then reports"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/ProximityPresentation\/State-swift.enum\/requestReceived(_:)","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" with who is asking"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and what: ask the holder, then respond or decline."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["import Foundation","import OID4VCWallet","","\/\/\/ What the holder agreed to share: a requested document, the held","\/\/\/ mdoc to answer it with, and the elements to disclose.","struct InPersonAnswer {","    let document: Int","    let credentialID: String","    let elements: [MdocPresentation.Element]","}","","\/\/\/ Shares an mdoc in person. `showQRCode` displays the code; `consent`","\/\/\/ shows the reader's request and returns the holder's answer, or nil","\/\/\/ to decline. Returns whether the copy shared had been seen by another","\/\/\/ Verifier, or nil when nothing was shared.","func shareInPerson(wallet: Wallet, showQRCode: (String) -> Void,","                   consent: (ProximityPresentation.Request) async -> InPersonAnswer?) async throws -> Bool? {","    let session = try wallet.startProximityPresentation()","    showQRCode(session.qrCode)","    for await state in session.states {","        switch state {","        case .requestReceived(let request):","            guard let answer = await consent(request) else {","                await session.decline()","                return nil","            }","            \/\/ The holder key signs now: Face ID, if the key store asks.","            return try await session.respond(document: answer.document, credentialID: answer.credentialID,","                                             elements: answer.elements)","        case .failed(let error):","            throw error","        case let state where state.isFinal:","            return nil","        default:","            continue","        }","    }","    return nil","}"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Show "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/ProximityPresentation\/Request\/reader","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" on the consent screen. A"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"reader that signs its request (reader authentication) is named, and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/ProximityReaderIdentity\/Status-swift.enum\/trusted","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" when its certificate chains"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"to "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/mdocReaderRoots","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":". An unsigned request could"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"come from anyone who scanned the code. As over the Digital Credentials"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"API, "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/requireTrustedMdocReader","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" ends a session"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"from any other reader before the holder sees it."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/ProximityPresentation\/cancel()","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" ends a session at any point, as the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"holder leaves the screen, say. "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/ProximityTimeouts","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" sets how long it"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"waits: by default 60 seconds for a reader to connect, 30 for its"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"request, and 300 for the holder to decide."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":3,"text":"Read as the verifier","type":"heading","anchor":"Read-as-the-verifier"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/ProximityReader","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" needs no "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":": give it the IACAs whose"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"mdocs it accepts, and, to sign its requests so holders see who is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"asking, a key in a "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/KeyStore","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" and its certificate chain, with the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"reader authentication extended key usage"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"("},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/ProximityReaderConfiguration","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":"). The reader is a production one: it"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"refuses ("},{"code":"invalidInput","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":") a configuration that leaves a decision open:"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"which IACAs issue which document types ("},{"code":"anyIssuerForAnyType","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", or"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"issuerRootsByDocType","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"), each role’s revocation ("},{"code":"revocation","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" with"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"crls","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", or "},{"code":"noRevocationCheck","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" to decline), and whether a document’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"revocation status is checked ("},{"code":"statusCheck","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"). "},{"code":"development","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" relaxes"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"this, for trying out a development issuer’s documents; never ship an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"app with it set. "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/ProximityReader\/start(qrCode:docType:elements:timeouts:)","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"takes the holder’s QR code and what to ask for."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["\/\/\/ Reads an mDL's name and portrait from the holder whose QR code was","\/\/\/ scanned. Returns the verified mdoc, its status checked, or nil if the","\/\/\/ holder declined.","func readInPerson(qrCode: String, issuerRoots: String, crls: String) async throws -> VerifiedMdoc? {","    let reader = try ProximityReader(configuration: ProximityReaderConfiguration(","        issuerRoots: issuerRoots, crls: crls, revocation: [.issuer, .status],","        anyIssuerForAnyType: true, statusCheck: .check))","    let session = try reader.start(qrCode: qrCode, docType: \"org.iso.18013.5.1.mDL\",","                                   elements: [\"org.iso.18013.5.1\": [\"given_name\", \"family_name\", \"portrait\"]])","    for await state in session.states {","        switch state {","        case .verified(let mdoc):","            \/\/ Its status was checked first: valid, or it names none.","            return mdoc","        case .failed(let error):","            \/\/ A revoked or suspended document is WalletError","            \/\/ .documentNotValid.","            throw error","        case let state where state.isFinal:","            return nil","        default:","            continue","        }","    }","    return nil","}"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/VerifiedMdoc","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" carries the disclosed elements, the document signer"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and the IACA it chains to, and its validity. Decide which issuers to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"accept on "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/VerifiedMdoc\/issuerChain","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":", the verified certificate path:"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/VerifiedMdoc\/issuer","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/VerifiedMdoc\/trustAnchor","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" are names any"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"document signer under a trusted IACA can choose, for display."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"With "},{"code":"statusCheck: .check","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", the session checks the document’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"revocation status before it’s "},{"code":".verified","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", as"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/ProximityReaderSession\/checkStatus()","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" does: it closes the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"connection, fetches the issuer’s status list over the network, so the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"reader needs a connection then, and verifies the list is signed under"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the certificate the document names or the CA that signed the document"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"signer (ISO\/IEC 18013-5 §12.3.6). Only a document that’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/MdocStatus\/valid","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":", or names no status ("},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/MdocStatus\/noStatus","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":"), is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":".verified","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", with "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/VerifiedMdoc\/status","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" set; any other status fails"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the session with "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletError","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":".documentNotValid","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", its"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"protocolError","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" the status. With "},{"code":".decline","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", nothing checks it:"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"for a reader where something else stands in, which then calls"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/ProximityReaderSession\/checkStatus()","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" itself or checks otherwise."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"sections":[],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet"]]},"references":{"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/MdocStatus/noStatus":{"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"case"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"noStatus"}],"url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/mdocstatus\/nostatus","kind":"symbol","title":"MdocStatus.noStatus","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/MdocStatus\/noStatus","abstract":[{"text":"The MSO names no revocation list.","type":"text"}],"role":"symbol","type":"topic"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/WalletConfiguration/mdocReaderRoots":{"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"mdocReaderRoots"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"String","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"}],"url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/walletconfiguration\/mdocreaderroots","kind":"symbol","title":"mdocReaderRoots","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/mdocReaderRoots","abstract":[{"text":"PEM certificates: the mdoc readers recognized when one signs an","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"org-iso-mdoc","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" request (","type":"text"},{"code":"MdocPresentation.Request.reader","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"). Empty:","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"every such request is shown by its origin.","type":"text"}],"role":"symbol","type":"topic"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/WalletConfiguration/requireTrustedMdocReader":{"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"requireTrustedMdocReader"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Bool","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb"}],"url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/walletconfiguration\/requiretrustedmdocreader","kind":"symbol","title":"requireTrustedMdocReader","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/requireTrustedMdocReader","abstract":[{"text":"Refuses an ","type":"text"},{"code":"org-iso-mdoc","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" request no recognized reader signed:","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"startMdocPresentation","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" throws ","type":"text"},{"code":"untrustedVerifier","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", and nothing is","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"shown to the holder. Needs ","type":"text"},{"code":"mdocReaderRoots","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"role":"symbol","type":"topic"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/MdocStatus/valid":{"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"case"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"valid"}],"url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/mdocstatus\/valid","kind":"symbol","title":"MdocStatus.valid","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/MdocStatus\/valid","abstract":[{"text":"Neither revoked nor suspended.","type":"text"}],"role":"symbol","type":"topic"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/ProximityPresentation":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The holder’s side of an ISO\/IEC 18013-5 in-person presentation over"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"BLE: show "},{"code":"qrCode","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", and the reader that scans it connects, or"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"advertises for the holder to connect, in one of the"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"ProximityBLEMode","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"s the session offers. Follow ","type":"text"},{"code":"states","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":": on ","type":"text"},{"code":".requestReceived","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", ask","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the holder, then ","type":"text"},{"code":"respond","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" or ","type":"text"},{"code":"decline","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":". ","type":"text"},{"code":"cancel","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" ends it at any","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"point. One request per session. The app’s Info.plist needs","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"NSBluetoothAlwaysUsageDescription.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","type":"topic","fragments":[{"text":"class","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"ProximityPresentation","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/ProximityPresentation","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/proximitypresentation","role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"ProximityPresentation","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"ProximityPresentation"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/WalletError":{"url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/walleterror","role":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"An error from OID4VCgo: a stable "},{"code":"code","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", the issuer’s, Authorization"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Server’s or Verifier’s own error code when it gave one"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"("},{"code":"protocolError","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"), and a message for logs: it never carries personal"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"data, a remote party’s own description, a URL’s path or query, or"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"control characters. "},{"code":"localizedDescription","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"a sentence fit to show the holder; "},{"code":"isRetryable","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" says whether trying"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the same step again may succeed."}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"WalletError","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol","type":"topic","title":"WalletError","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletError","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"WalletError","kind":"identifier"}]},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/VerifiedMdoc/trustAnchor":{"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"let"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"trustAnchor"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"String","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"}],"url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/verifiedmdoc\/trustanchor","kind":"symbol","title":"trustAnchor","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/VerifiedMdoc\/trustAnchor","abstract":[{"text":"The common name of the IACA it chains to, for display.","type":"text"}],"role":"symbol","type":"topic"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/ProximityPresentation/State-swift.enum/requestReceived(_:)":{"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"case"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"requestReceived"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Request","preciseIdentifier":"s:12OID4VCWallet21ProximityPresentationC7RequestV"},{"kind":"text","text":")"}],"url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/proximitypresentation\/state-swift.enum\/requestreceived(_:)","kind":"symbol","title":"ProximityPresentation.State.requestReceived(_:)","i